                <h4 class="box-title text-info m-t-40">Statistiche mensili suddivise per <strong>Zona / Inquinante</strong></h4>
                <hr class="m-t-0 m-b-20">
                <p>Visualizza le statistiche mensili per una data zona selezionando l'inquinante.</p>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 m-b-10 input-group">
                        <input type="text" class="form-control clear-input" id="show-stats-month" name="show-stats-month" placeholder="mm/yyyy">
                        <div class="input-group-append">
                            <span class="input-group-text"><i class="icon-calender"></i></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 m-b-10">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="show-stats-network-month" name="show-stats-network-month">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona rete...</option>
                            % foreach my $net (@{$networks}){
                                <option value="<%= $net->{'st_network_id'} %>"><%= $net->{'st_network_desc'} %></option>
                            % }
                        </select>
                    </div> -->
                    <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 m-b-10">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="show-stats-zone-month" name="show-stats-zone-month" data-dest="show-stats-pollutant-month">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona zona...</option>
                            % foreach my $zone (@{$zones}){
                                <option value="<%= $zone->{'sz_id'} %>"><%= $zone->{'sz_name'} %></option>
                            % }
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 m-b-10 stat-buttons">
                        <select class="custom-select col-12" id="show-stats-pollutant-month" name="show-stats-pollutant-month">
                            <option value="-1">Seleziona inquinante...</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
